{"id": "024bd5bc-c382-4c3e-9722-b18edc94a8ff", "slug": "summit-raw-performance-elegant-intelligence", "title": "Summit — Raw Performance & Elegant Intelligence", "description": "Summit Raw Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Summit — Raw Performance & Elegant Intelligence\"\ndescription: \"Summit Raw Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#968453\"\n  secondary: \"#2D2A1E\"\n  accent: \"#C4BCA2\"\n  background: \"#DFD8BE\"\n  surface: \"#2D2A1E\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#2D2A1E\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Plus Jakarta Sans\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Playfair Display\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Summit — Raw Performance & Elegant Intelligence\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sakura DesignCode (@sakura-designcode). Views: 38; favorites: 3; remixes: 0.\nTags: button, animated, cta, dither, action, effect.\n## Overview\nSummit Raw Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nSUMMIT Philosophy Architecture Systems Initiate Core Volume 01 // Architectural Clarity A quiet alternative to the digital noise. Engineered for deep compute. Summit A-01 Less artificial. More intelligence. We built Sum…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: A quiet alternative to the digital noise. Engineered for deep compute.; Less artificial. More intelligence.; AI has a hype problem. Summit is the antidote.; Architectural Restraint; Contextual Processing; Sustainable Infrastructure.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #968453, secondary #2D2A1E, accent #C4BCA2, background #DFD8BE, surface #2D2A1E, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Plus Jakarta Sans for display moments and Playfair Display for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"scroll-smooth\"><head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Summit — Raw Performance &amp; Elegant Intelligence</title>\n  <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <!-- Iconify Icons -->\n  <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n  <!-- Google Fonts for authentic premium typography -->\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n  <style>\n    body {\n      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;\n    }\n    .serif-title {\n      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\n    }\n    /* Smooth blur transitions */\n    .reveal-item {\n      opacity: 0;\n      transform: translateY(20px);\n      filter: blur(8px);\n      transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n    }\n    .reveal-item.active {\n      opacity: 1;\n      transform: translateY(0);\n      filter: blur(0);\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"bg-[#dfd8be] text-[#2d2a1e] relative min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-[#2d2a1e] selection:text-[#dfd8be]\">\n\n  <!-- Topographic Flow Field Background (WebGL/Canvas Simulation) -->\n  <canvas id=\"topo-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none mix-blend-multiply opacity-50 z-0\"></canvas>\n\n  <!-- Navigation -->\n  <header class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-6 flex justify-between items-center\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <!-- Premium SVG Logo Mark -->\n      <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-[#2d2a1e]\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n        <path d=\"M12 2V22M2 12H22M5 5L19 19M19 5L5 19\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n      </svg>\n      <span class=\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight\">SUMMIT</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm font-medium\">\n      <a href=\"#philosophy\" class=\"hover:text-amber-900 transition-colors\">Philosophy</a>\n      <a href=\"#architecture\" class=\"hover:text-amber-900 transition-colors\">Architecture</a>\n      <a href=\"#systems\" class=\"hover:text-amber-900 transition-colors\">Systems</a>\n    </nav>\n\n    <div>\n      <a href=\"#cta\" class=\"relative group overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-[#2d2a1e] text-[#fdfbf7] px-5 py-2 text-sm font-medium inline-block transition-transform active:scale-95\">\n        <span class=\"relative z-10 flex items-center gap-1\">\n          Initiate Core <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n        </span>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#4e4835] translate-y-full group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-300\"></div>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- Hero Section & Reference Split Interface -->\n  <main class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pt-12 pb-24\">\n\n    <!-- Intro Tagline -->\n    <div class=\"mb-16 max-w-2xl reveal-item\" id=\"intro-text\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-amber-900/60 block mb-4\">Volume 01 // Architectural Clarity</span>\n      <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tighter serif-title text-[#2d2a1e] leading-tight\">\n        A quiet alternative to the digital noise. Engineered for deep compute.\n      </h1>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- MAIN REFERENCE INTERFACE (The Dual Columns) -->\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-stretch mb-24\">\n\n      <!-- LEFT CARD: Less Artificial -->\n      <div class=\"reveal-item flex flex-col rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-[#c4bca2] bg-[#fdfbf7] shadow-xl group hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500\" style=\"transition-delay: 100ms;\">\n        <!-- Image & Hero Section -->\n        <div class=\"relative h-[480px] md:h-[580px] w-full overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between p-8\">\n          <!-- Background Image with precise vintage earth color grading -->\n          <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\">\n            <video src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779252545569-c971d5eb-a258-4a13-8c77-4e6d52129d16.mp4\" poster=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779244912966-c4369c46-95fb-4680-b87b-7051eff89eee.png\" data-neuform-generated-video=\"true\" data-neuform-video-preset=\"loop-in-view\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" preload=\"metadata\" loop=\"\" aria-label=\"Muted Earthy Mountain Range\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\"></video>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#2d2a1e]/90 via-[#2d2a1e]/40 to-[#2d2a1e]/10 mix-blend-multiply\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#968453]/20 mix-blend-color\"></div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Top Brand Identifier -->\n          <div class=\"relative z-10 flex justify-between items-center text-white/90\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-white\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n                <path d=\"M12 2V22M2 12H22M5 5L19 19M19 5L5 19\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n              </svg>\n              <span class=\"text-xl font-medium tracking-tight\">Summit</span>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold opacity-70\">A-01</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Bottom Main Headline -->\n          <div class=\"relative z-10\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight mb-4\">\n              Less artificial.<br>More intelligence.\n            </h2>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Editorial Sand Panel Base -->\n        <div class=\"p-8 md:p-12 bg-[#f4ebd0] flex-grow flex flex-col justify-between border-t border-[#c4bca2]\">\n          <p class=\"text-[#4e4835] text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-md\">\n            We built Summit for teams that ship, not teams that tinker. One foundational layer of clean intelligence, and it keeps getting smarter.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-[#2d2a1e]/10 flex justify-between items-center\">\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-[#4e4835]/70\">01 / Foundation</span>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"group/btn flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#2d2a1e] hover:text-amber-900 transition-colors\">\n              Explore Layer <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"group-hover/btn:translate-x-1 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n            </a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- RIGHT CARD: The Antidote -->\n      <div class=\"reveal-item flex flex-col rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-[#c4bca2] bg-[#fdfbf7] shadow-xl group hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500\" style=\"transition-delay: 300ms;\">\n        <!-- Image & Hero Section -->\n        <div class=\"relative h-[480px] md:h-[580px] w-full overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between p-8\">\n          <!-- Background Image 2 (Misty Fjord/Lake Landscape) -->\n          <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\">\n            <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779244951270-9df6be94-ac0e-47e1-9662-1301d569618d.png\" alt=\"Misty Dusk Fjord Mirroring Mountains\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779244951270-9df6be94-ac0e-47e1-9662-1301d569618d.png\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#2d2a1e]/90 via-[#2d2a1e]/40 to-[#2d2a1e]/10 mix-blend-multiply\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#968453]/20 mix-blend-color\"></div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Top Brand Identifier -->\n          <div class=\"relative z-10 flex justify-end items-center text-white/90\">\n            <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-white\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n              <path d=\"M12 2V22M2 12H22M5 5L19 19M19 5L5 19\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Bottom Main Headline -->\n          <div class=\"relative z-10\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight mb-4\">\n              AI has a hype<br>problem. Summit is<br>the antidote.\n            </h2>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Editorial Sand Panel Base -->\n        <div class=\"p-8 md:p-12 bg-[#f4ebd0] flex-grow flex flex-col justify-between border-t border-[#c4bca2]\">\n          <p class=\"text-[#4e4835] text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-md\">\n            While everyone else is chasing synthetic benchmarks and burning through models, we're quietly crafting the underlying workflows that deliver actual work.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-[#2d2a1e]/10 flex justify-between items-center\">\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-[#4e4835]/70\">02 / Delivery</span>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"group/btn flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#2d2a1e] hover:text-amber-900 transition-colors\">\n              See the Benchmark <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"group-hover/btn:translate-x-1 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n            </a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Additional Editorial Section: Core Pillars -->\n    <div id=\"philosophy\" class=\"pt-12 border-t border-[#2d2a1e]/20\">\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12\">\n        <div class=\"reveal-item\" style=\"transition-delay: 100ms;\">\n          <div class=\"p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#c4bca2] via-transparent to-transparent rounded-lg\">\n            <div class=\"p-6 bg-[#dfd8be]/20 rounded-lg\">\n              <span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#4e4835] mb-4 block\">01 / Minimal Overhead</span>\n              <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight mb-2\">Architectural Restraint</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-[#4e4835] leading-relaxed\">\n                Zero bloated tracking layers or unnecessary telemetry. Standard components compiled directly to modern micro-pipelines.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"reveal-item\" style=\"transition-delay: 200ms;\">\n          <div class=\"p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#c4bca2] via-transparent to-transparent rounded-lg\">\n            <div class=\"p-6 bg-[#dfd8be]/20 rounded-lg\">\n              <span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#4e4835] mb-4 block\">02 / Dynamic Routing</span>\n              <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight mb-2\">Contextual Processing</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-[#4e4835] leading-relaxed\">\n                Automatically maps workload intensity to optimal execution endpoints, saving power and latency dynamically.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"reveal-item\" style=\"transition-delay: 300ms;\">\n          <div class=\"p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#c4bca2] via-transparent to-transparent rounded-lg\">\n            <div class=\"p-6 bg-[#dfd8be]/20 rounded-lg\">\n              <span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#4e4835] mb-4 block\">03 / Enduring Build</span>\n              <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight mb-2\">Sustainable Infrastructure</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-sm text-[#4e4835] leading-relaxed\">\n                Crafted specifically for long-form reliability and local resilience. Summit lives natively wherever your servers reside.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Dynamic CTA Section with Border Gradients -->\n    <section id=\"cta\" class=\"mt-32 reveal-item\">\n      <div class=\"relative rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-16 overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#fdfbf7] to-[#f4ebd0] border border-[#c4bca2] shadow-2xl\">\n        <!-- Subtle noise overlay simulation in canvas background -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-cover bg-center opacity-[0.03]\" style=\"background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=%220 0 200 200%22 xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%3E%3Cfilter id=%22noise%22%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=%22fractalNoise%22 baseFrequency=%220.8%22 numOctaves=%224%22 stitchTiles=%22stitch%22/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=%22100%25%22 height=%22100%25%22 filter=%22url(%23noise)%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E')\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center\">\n          <span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-900/60 mb-6 block\">Ready to Ascend</span>\n          <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl tracking-tighter serif-title text-[#2d2a1e] leading-tight mb-6\">\n            Begin with quiet structural power.\n          </h2>\n          <p class=\"text-base text-[#4e4835] mb-10 max-w-md mx-auto leading-relaxed\">\n            Configure your local cluster interface or opt for zero-setup cloud environments. Beautifully designed telemetry included.\n          </p>\n\n          <form class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 max-w-md mx-auto\" onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault(); alert('Summit registration received.');\">\n            <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Enter your system identifier...\" required=\"\" class=\"flex-grow px-5 py-3 rounded-xl border border-[#c4bca2] bg-white text-[#2d2a1e] placeholder-[#4e4835]/40 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#2d2a1e]/20 focus:border-[#2d2a1e]/40 transition-all\">\n            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"relative group overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-[#2d2a1e] text-[#fdfbf7] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium transition-transform active:scale-95 flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"relative z-10\">Deploy Now</span>\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-sm relative z-10\"></iconify-icon>\n              <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#4e4835] translate-y-full group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-300\"></div>\n            </button>\n          </form>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- Premium Minimal Footer -->\n  <footer class=\"relative z-10 border-t border-[#c4bca2] bg-[#eae3ca]/80 py-12 text-xs text-[#4e4835]/80\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-6\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n        <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#2d2a1e]\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n          <path d=\"M12 2V22M2 12H22M5 5L19 19M19 5L5 19\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight\">SUMMIT INC.</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex gap-8\">\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-amber-950 transition-colors\">Documentation</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-amber-950 transition-colors\">Privacy</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-amber-950 transition-colors\">System Status</a>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <span>© 2026 Summit Technologies. Built with structural clarity.</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <!-- WebGL/Dynamic Topographic Canvas Logic & Intersection Observer Animation Script -->\n  <script>\n    // 1. Dynamic Canvas Animation (Generates a moving topographic/fluid background matching desert vibes)\n    const canvas = document.getElementById('topo-canvas');\n    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n\n    let width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n    let height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n\n    window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n      width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n      height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n    });\n\n    let lines = [];\n    const lineCount = 18;\n    const segments = 120;\n\n    class TopoLine {\n      constructor(yOffset) {\n        this.yOffset = yOffset;\n        this.seed = Math.random() * 100;\n        this.speed = 0.003 + Math.random() * 0.002;\n      }\n\n      draw(time) {\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(78, 72, 53, 0.05)';\n        ctx.lineWidth = 1.5;\n\n        for (let i = 0; i <= segments; i++) {\n          const x = (i / segments) * width;\n          // Fluid wavy motion combining sine waves for high-end organic flow field\n          const noise = Math.sin(i * 0.05 + this.seed + time * this.speed) * 40 +\n                        Math.sin(i * 0.02 - this.seed + time * this.speed * 1.5) * 80;\n\n          const y = (this.yOffset / lineCount) * height + noise;\n          if (i === 0) {\n            ctx.moveTo(x, y);\n          } else {\n            ctx.lineTo(x, y);\n          }\n        }\n        ctx.stroke();\n      }\n    }\n\n    // Initialize flowing lines\n    for (let i = 0; i < lineCount; i++) {\n      lines.push(new TopoLine(i + 1));\n    }\n\n    let time = 0;\n    function animate() {\n      ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n      time += 1.2;\n      lines.forEach(line => line.draw(time));\n      requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n    }\n    animate();\n\n    // 2. Intersection Observer for blur/fade-in animation sequence\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n      const revealItems = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-item');\n\n      const observerOptions = {\n        root: null,\n        rootMargin: '0px',\n        threshold: 0.1\n      };\n\n      const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries, observer) => {\n        entries.forEach(entry => {\n          if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n            entry.target.classList.add('active');\n            observer.unobserve(entry.target); // Trigger animation once\n          }\n        });\n      }, observerOptions);\n\n      revealItems.forEach(item => {\n        observer.observe(item);\n      });\n    });\n  </script>\n\n<script data-neuform-video-controller=\"true\">\n(function () {\n  function playVideo(video) {\n    var promise = video.play();\n    if (promise && typeof promise.catch === \"function\") {\n      promise.catch(function () {});\n    }\n  }\n  function setupVideo(video) {\n    if (video.__neuformVideoReady === true) return;\n    video.__neuformVideoReady = true;\n    video.muted = true;\n    video.playsInline = true;\n    var preset = video.dataset.neuformVideoPreset || \"loop-in-view\";\n    if (preset === \"hover\") {\n      video.addEventListener(\"mouseenter\", function () { playVideo(video); });\n      video.addEventListener(\"mouseleave\", function () {\n        video.pause();\n        video.currentTime = 0;\n      });\n      return;\n    }\n    if (!(\"IntersectionObserver\" in window)) {\n      playVideo(video);\n      return;\n    }\n    var observer = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {\n      entries.forEach(function (entry) {\n        if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n          if (preset === \"play-once\" && video.__neuformVideoPlayed === true) return;\n          playVideo(video);\n        } else {\n          video.pause();\n        }\n      });\n    }, { threshold: 0.35 });\n    if (preset === \"play-once\") {\n      video.addEventListener(\"ended\", function () {\n        video.__neuformVideoPlayed = true;\n      }, { once: true });\n    }\n    observer.observe(video);\n  }\n  function setupVideos() {\n    document.querySelectorAll(\"video[data-neuform-video-preset]\").forEach(setupVideo);\n  }\n  if (document.readyState === \"loading\") {\n    document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", setupVideos);\n  } else {\n    setupVideos();\n  }\n})();</script></body></html>", "preview_file_name": "summit-raw-performance-elegant-intelligence.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/summit-raw-performance-elegant-intelligence.jpg", "source_name": "summit-raw-performance-elegant-intelligence-DESIGN.md", "views": 141, "forks": 7, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "f78092cf-e149-48ff-99e9-efabe9a28d39", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T15:55:53.591801+00:00"}